<title>USA: Sterling Chemicals to buy Cytec unit.</title>
<headline>Sterling Chemicals to buy Cytec unit.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stering Chemicals Holdings Inc said Tuesday it had a definitive agreement to buy the acrylic fiber business of Cytec Industries Inc for an undisclosed amount.</p>
<p>The acrylic fibers unit, with full-year revenues expected to be about $140 million, will be accretive to earnings, Sterling said.</p>
<p>It said the transaction should be completed by the first quarter of 1997.</p>
</text>
